<title>SAN MARINO: TENNIS-SAN MARINO MEN'S TENNIS TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SAN MARINO MEN'S TENNIS TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SAN MARINO 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results of the</p>
<p>$300,000 San Marino men's clay court tournament on Wednesday</p>
<p>(prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Andrei Pavel (Romania) beat 2-Alberto Berasategui (Spain) 6-3</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Magnus Gustaffson (Sweden) beat Alberto Martin (Spain)  7-6</p>
<p>(7-3) 6-2</p>
<p>6-Dominik Hrbaty (Slovakia) beat Hendrik Dreekmann (Germany)</p>
<p>5-7 7-5 withdrew</p>
<p>Adrian Voinea (Romania) beat Andrea Gaudenzi (Italy) 6-0 6-3</p>
</text>
